---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Teaching & Outreach" description="Programming and machine learning teaching, student research supervision, AI literacy and academic activities.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Academic &amp; community activities</div>
    <h1>Teaching, Mentoring &amp; Outreach</h1>
    <p class="lead">My academic work includes teaching programming and machine learning, supervising student research, and contributing to AI education and research communities.</p>
  </div></section>
  <div class="container page-content"><div class="detail-grid">
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>Teaching</h2>
      <p>I have taught and tutored students in programming and machine learning through laboratory instruction, regular classes and introductory AI training.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>C programming:</strong> laboratory instruction involving programming exercises and practical problem solving.</li>
        <li><strong>Machine learning:</strong> classes and tutoring covering learning methods, implementation and evaluation.</li>
        <li><strong>Introduction to AI with Python:</strong> hands-on sessions introducing AI concepts through Python exercises.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Student research supervision and mentoring</h2>
      <p>My supervision experience covers undergraduate final-year and master's-level projects in machine learning for wireless localization. I have supported students in formulating research problems, implementing methods, planning experiments and interpreting their results.</p>
      <p>Supervised work has contributed to research presented at IEEE conferences, including WCNC and PIMRC. I have also mentored students through machine learning and research-focused learning activities.</p>
      <h2>AI literacy and outreach</h2>
      <p>I have contributed to introductory AI training, webinars and community learning activities, explaining AI methods to participants with different levels of technical experience.</p>
      <h2>Community roles and academic service</h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">Black in AI · Emerging Leaders in AI (ELAI)</div><h3>Program facilitation and mentoring</h3><p>Facilitation, community engagement and mentoring within the ELAI program, supporting research-oriented learning and exchanges among participants.</p></div>
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">AURA Association</div><h3>Directeur scientifique et contenu thématique</h3><p>Contribution to scientific content and knowledge-sharing activities within the association.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p>I also contribute to academic peer review by assessing research manuscripts.</p>
      <h2>Conference presentations</h2>
      <p>My research presentations at international conferences are listed on the <a href={withBase('/talks/')}>Talks &amp; Presentations page</a>, with references to the corresponding papers.</p>
    </article>
    <aside class="sidebar-panel"><h3>Related pages</h3>
      <p class="small"><a href={withBase('/talks/')}>Talks &amp; Presentations ↗</a></p>
      <p class="small"><a href={withBase('/publications/')}>Publications ↗</a></p>
      <p class="small"><a href={withBase('/about/')}>About ↗</a></p>
      <p class="small"><a href={withBase('/cv/')}>CV ↗</a></p>
    </aside>
  </div></div>
</BaseLayout>